<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <title>Relatório de Resgates</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .header {
      background: #000;
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .header img {
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .header h1 {
      color: #ffffff;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 30px;
    }

    .greeting {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #333333;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .intro-text {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #666666;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .period-box {
      background-color: #fafafa;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    th {
      background-color: #000;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 10px;
      text-align: left;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    td {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      padding: 10px;
      color: #333;
    }

    tr:nth-child(even) {
      background-color: #fafafa;
    }

    .alert {
      background-color: #fff7ed;
      border: 1px solid #fed7aa;
      color: #9a3412;
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .footer {
      padding: 20px 30px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #777777;
      background-color: #f9fafb;
    }

    @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
      .content {
        padding: 20px;
      }

      table, thead, tbody, th, td, tr {
        display: block;
      }

      th {
        display: none;
      }

      td {
        padding: 8px;
        border: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="container">

  <div class="header">
    <img src="cid:logo" alt="Logo">
    <h1>Relatório de Resgates</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="content">

    <div class="greeting">
      Olá, <strong>{{adminName}}</strong>!
    </div>

    <div class="intro-text">
      Segue abaixo a listagem de todos os resgates realizados na loja no período informado.
    </div>

    <div class="period-box">
      <strong>Período:</strong> {{startAt}} até {{endAt}}<br>
      <strong>Total de resgates:</strong> {{claimsLength}}
    </div>

    <table>
      <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Usuário</th>
        <th>Produto</th>
        <th>Data do Resgate</th>
      </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
      {{#each claims}}
        <tr>
          <td>{{userName}}</td>
          <td>{{productName}}</td>
          <td>{{date}}</td>
        </tr>
      {{/each}}
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="intro-text">
      Este e-mail é gerado automaticamente pelo sistema e tem caráter informativo.
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    © 2025 Dragon Store.
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
